
# Security Policy

## Reporting a Vulnerability

Please do not disclose security vulnerabilities through public GitHub issues.

Report suspected vulnerabilities privately to the repository maintainer.

## Security Principles

- Never commit API keys or credentials.
- Avoid storing unnecessary personal information.
- Validate external inputs.
- Apply least-privilege access.
- Document security-sensitive changes.
- Review dependencies regularly.

## Scope

Security reports concerning data exposure, authentication, authorisation, dependency vulnerabilities and decision record integrity are welcome.
